I have analyzed the current block classification heuristics in `block-classify.ts` and proposed a genuinely different architecture: **Emitter-Aware Grammar Parsing**. 

This approach shifts away from guessing structures based on plain-text regexes and instead injects out-of-band context (the active process) to apply declarative parser combinator grammars, turning text into structural Abstract Syntax Trees.

